1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,740
245 animals lived in this one rock.

2
00:00:04,367 --> 00:00:06,207
It's about the size of a fist.

3
00:00:07,117 --> 00:00:09,419
It comes from the
bottom of the Pacific,

4
00:00:09,419 --> 00:00:11,381
four to six kilometers down.

5
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:14,933
Scientists checked
244 of these rocks,

6
00:00:14,933 --> 00:00:17,560
and found over 4,000 animals.

7
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,743
Tiny ones, less than a
millimeter long, living inside.

8
00:00:22,367 --> 00:00:24,154
The average was 17 per rock.

9
00:00:24,154 --> 00:00:25,780
This one was packed.

10
00:00:26,367 --> 00:00:28,129
But these rocks
are rich in metal,

11
00:00:28,129 --> 00:00:29,981
and people want to mine them.

12
00:00:30,617 --> 00:00:33,791
And they grow only a few
millimeters in a million years.

13
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:36,293
Take the rock, lose the city.
